"""ORBStraddle Empirical Quantitative Signals Module.

Implements institutional quantitative filters from SIGNALS.md, PLAN.md, and empirical_spec.md:
- RVOL (Relative Volume >= 1.20 Index ETF, >= 1.40 Stocks)
- WBR (Wick-to-Body Ratio <= 3.50, Indecision Wick Trap Lockout)
- Pre-Market Gap Conditioning (0.10%-1.80% ETFs, 0.20%-4.50% Stocks)
- SOFI (Signed Order Flow Imbalance |z| >= 2.0, Cont-Kukanov-Stoikov 2014)
- Quote Freshness (<= 5,000 ms) and Displayed Depth (>= $25k both sides)
"""

